{"id":4879,"date":"2025-07-30T08:55:07","date_gmt":"2025-07-30T08:55:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4879"},"modified":"2025-08-28T09:24:24","modified_gmt":"2025-08-28T02:24:24","slug":"lemon-digital-tai-tiktok-shop-vietnam-2025","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/su-kien\/lemon-digital-tai-tiktok-shop-vietnam-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Lemon Digital \u0111\u1ea1t gi\u1ea3i TSP Partner Of The Year t\u1ea1i TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"HgWvdI32dog9PBxt2jolnIERgIc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FoBSdKyaKoLi68xORcTlHal2gad\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u0103m 2025 ghi d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u1eb7t l\u1ecbch s\u1eed trong cu\u1ed9c h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital. T\u1ea1i TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ng\u00e0y 17\/7\/2025, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i vinh d\u1ef1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u01b0\u1edbng t\u00ean \u1edf danh m\u1ee5c danh gi\u00e1 nh\u1ea5t \u2014 \u2018TikTok Shop Partner Of The Year\u2019. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 danh hi\u1ec7u, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 l\u1eddi tuy\u00ean ng\u00f4n m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u1ec1 n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i v\u00e0 t\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i TikTok Shop t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam. Ngay b\u00e2y gi\u1edd, h\u00e3y c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong><\/a> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4881\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4881\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4881\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/48.png\" alt=\"S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025 di\u1ec5n ra ho\u00e0nh tr\u00e1ng v\u1edbi quy m\u00f4 h\u01a1n 1.000 kh\u00e1ch m\u1eddi\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/48.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/48-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/48-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/48-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/48-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4881\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025 di\u1ec5n ra ho\u00e0nh tr\u00e1ng v\u1edbi quy m\u00f4 h\u01a1n 1.000 kh\u00e1ch m\u1eddi<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"HgWvdI32dog9PBxt2jolnIERgIc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DgoNdafu9o6Moxxvpz6lMiVUgBg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DPXzdu51joG47kxRiBMl3C5Zgld\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. C\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c 5 n\u0103m \u0111\u1ea7y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Jz2vdhVMQoSfBIxPOPTlHD6Rgpd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 2021 \u2013 Kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FC5fd59xmokUoex1aG9lHpiWg3g\">Th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp n\u0103m 2021 b\u1edfi hai s\u00e1ng l\u1eadp vi\u00ean tr\u1ebb v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 ban \u0111\u1ea7u ch\u1ec9 g\u1ed3m 2 ng\u01b0\u1eddi. Lemon Digital kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh trong ng\u00e0nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 SME v\u00e0 D2C t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam. \u0110\u1ebfn n\u0103m 2024 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng h\u01a1n 100 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, bao g\u1ed3m Polomanor, Shegan, GearVN, Logitech, Shondo, Api,\u2026<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Inh2dymf6oIy6vxvg2LlT49Xgzd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 2022 \u2013 2023: <\/strong><strong>X\u00e2y n\u1ec1n<\/strong><strong> v\u00e0 b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J9qFdwHAvodpE9xKpqilEgEWgkg\">Trong v\u00f2ng ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ea7y 4 n\u0103m ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, Lemon \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh Top 3 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u00f3 GMV cao nh\u1ea5t tr\u00ean TikTok Shop qu\u00fd 1\/2024; \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn l\u00e0 Ecommerce Enabler h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2023 tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TM\u0110T l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 Shopee, Lazada, Haravan<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TiXUd5AwHoZaSpxUHvXlysLFguh\">T\u1eeb th\u00e1ng 12\/2023, Lemon Digital li\u00ean t\u1ee5c gi\u1eef v\u1ecb th\u1ebf Top \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c b\u1eadc nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop trong su\u1ed1t 7 th\u00e1ng li\u1ec1n, t\u1eeb th\u00e1ng 12\/2023 \u0111\u1ebfn \u00edt nh\u1ea5t gi\u1eefa 2024<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QcPKd3IvKoLM2MxbZYZlSBFpg8C\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 2023 \u2013 \u0110\u1ea7u 2024: \u0110\u1ed9t ph\u00e1 v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n l\u1edbn<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMRldR9uyoNxRdxFwn6l21d7gpc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-NHpsdboILoN97QxkeqgldK1tg1d\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d192311e-1b4a-4979-89ea-b785b9b0e216&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQA1GbPTzwos5N7x7aWhltAQ6gTh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QA1GbPTzwos5N7x7aWhltAQ6gTh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1075054,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4883\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4883\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4883\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/50.png\" alt=\"Lemon Digital li\u00ean t\u1ee5c t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9t ph\u00e1 qua c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n l\u1edbn, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 g\u1eb7t h\u00e1i nh\u1eefng th\u1eafng l\u1ee3i \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ea3 v\u1ec1 doanh thu, uy t\u00edn th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 v\u1ecb th\u1ebf trong ng\u00e0nh.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/50.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/50-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/50-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/50-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/50-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4883\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lemon Digital li\u00ean t\u1ee5c t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9t ph\u00e1 qua c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n l\u1edbn, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 g\u1eb7t h\u00e1i nh\u1eefng th\u1eafng l\u1ee3i \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ea3 v\u1ec1 doanh thu, uy t\u00edn th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 v\u1ecb th\u1ebf trong ng\u00e0nh.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NBxVdXn8ioZ1MZxW4a5leLv0gFd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SOJQdPuuMopAvdxlP5blzw7KgLh\">Cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng 3\/2024, Lemon Digital t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng Mega Campaign \u201cLemon Day\u201d l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n TikTok Shop Partner Mega Day \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u1edbi 22 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tham gia, 25 phi\u00ean livestream li\u00ean t\u1ee5c trong 24h, mang l\u1ea1i gia t\u0103ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng l\u00ean t\u1edbi 300% so v\u1edbi ng\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng. Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ea7n chay nh\u01b0 Shegan t\u0103ng doanh thu \u0111\u1ebfn 250% trong m\u1ed9t phi\u00ean livestream<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Z7JVdf4HcoT8EBxn7oilqR9DgDc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 2024 \u2013 Gi\u1eefa 2025: <\/strong><strong>M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ecb th\u1ebf<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GiHPdQ8o6oGOxdxQRuolSuyKgAg\">\u0110\u1ebfn gi\u1eefa n\u0103m 2025, Lemon Digital ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 l\u00ean h\u01a1n 60 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh h\u01a1n 300 d\u1ef1 \u00e1n, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 h\u01a1n 300 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OYrgdP6SSoLkk2xcup3lWEQNg8d\">Ng\u00e0y 19\/6\/2025, t\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Shopee Brands \u00d7 Creators Conference 2025 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c t\u1ea1i TP.HCM c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 1.500 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, creators tham d\u1ef1, Lemon Digital vinh d\u1ef1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trao gi\u1ea3i cao nh\u1ea5t \u201cBest Enabler Of The Year\u201d cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 xu\u1ea5t s\u1eafc nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a Shopee. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 c\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t d\u00e0nh cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u00f3 \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3p xu\u1ea5t s\u1eafc nh\u1ea5t trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i Shopee, kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh vai tr\u00f2 ti\u00ean phong c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital trong vi\u1ec7c k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u00e0 trao quy\u1ec1n cho c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f9ng creator ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KlYWdipTVoHbOIxPN5qlwIwsgrg\">T\u1ea1i TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025 di\u1ec5n ra ng\u00e0y 26\/7\/2025 v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 tham d\u1ef1 c\u1ee7a h\u01a1n 1.500 \u0111\u1ea1i bi\u1ec3u g\u1ed3m seller, creator v\u00e0 c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 vinh d\u1ef1 nh\u1eadn gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng &#8220;TikTok Shop Partner Of The Year&#8221;. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ghi nh\u1eadn quan tr\u1ecdng kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ecb th\u1ebf c\u1ee7a c\u00f4ng ty nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u trong vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng seller v\u00e0 creator x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kinh doanh b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZmeAdliPqoSYTjxHOV3lELkNgDf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. Nh\u1eefng th\u00e0nh t\u1ef1u n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt <\/strong><strong>c\u1ee7a Lemon t\u1ea1i TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025 <\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BuYidY9zsoyzGaxl5m9lHoALgkr\">T\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025, di\u1ec5n ra v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 17\/7\/2025 t\u1ea1i TP.HCM v\u1edbi ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 <em>\u201cH\u1ee9ng kh\u1edfi kinh doanh \u2013 V\u1eefng v\u00e0ng t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng\u201d<\/em>, Lemon Digital vinh d\u1ef1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u01b0\u1edbng t\u00ean trong h\u1ea1ng m\u1ee5c danh gi\u00e1 \u201cTikTok Shop Partner of the Year\u201d, t\u00f4n vinh \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c xu\u1ea5t s\u1eafc nh\u1ea5t h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i TikTok Shop Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLeVdN9a7oS2v6xsnEZlRcTTgJh\">T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, Lemon Digital t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o chia s\u1ebb v\u1ec1 h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng UVGREEN \u2014 m\u1ed9t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u gia d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt tr\u00ean TikTok Shop. \u00d4ng Ph\u00e1t Nguy\u1ec5n \u2013 Co\u2011Founder &amp; CSO c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c <em>\u201cUVGREEN x Lemon Digital \u2013 Gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 m\u00f9a Mega Sales\u201d<\/em>.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-EdAydwXufo1nljxyIyVl8bXWgvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;83575121-8a2f-427d-acbc-6d3e8d7c5282&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXP2Vbf5Szo2ZJex9EYSlxkDAgBd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;XP2Vbf5Szo2ZJex9EYSlxkDAgBd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:877445,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;83575121-8a2f-427d-acbc-6d3e8d7c5282&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;sca