1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FY0uQbBc8wo7EV1x9Bh1lQeVggLb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Y0uQbBc8wo7EV1x9Bh1lQeVggLb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1266013,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;90f5b48d-6c65-4549-a5f7-94da1c26aab4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FY0uQbBc8wo7EV1x9Bh1lQeVggLb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Y0uQbBc8wo7EV1x9Bh1lQeVggLb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1266013,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4887\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4887\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4887\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-2.png\" alt=\"\u00d4ng Ph\u00e1t chia s\u1ebb c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh TikTok Shop to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n, t\u1eeb chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 l\u1eadp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4887\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u00d4ng Ph\u00e1t chia s\u1ebb c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh TikTok Shop to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n, t\u1eeb chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 l\u1eadp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;90f5b48d-6c65-4549-a5f7-94da1c26aab4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FY0uQbBc8wo7EV1x9Bh1lQeVggLb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Y0uQbBc8wo7EV1x9Bh1lQeVggLb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1266013,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"HgWvdI32dog9PBxt2jolnIERgIc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OQjMdVi0ooNLEUxFSJelfvisghf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00e0 Alice Tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c TikTok t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u1eebng nh\u1eadn x\u00e9t r\u1eb1ng: \u201cCh\u00fang t\u00f4i th\u1ea5y r\u00f5 s\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ea3 v\u1ec1 s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital trong n\u0103m 2023\u201d. L\u1eddi c\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn \u1ea5y ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea1i Summit 2025, khi ch\u00fang t\u00f4i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vinh danh nh\u1edd kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u t\u1eeb x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed1i \u01b0u v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh, gi\u00fap h\u1ecd nhanh ch\u00f3ng th\u00edch nghi v\u1edbi xu h\u01b0\u1edbng TM\u0110T v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea1t t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PBohdsBFEomdQZxe9YdlMFDXgNh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Danh hi\u1ec7u \u201cTikTok Shop Partner of the Year\u201d \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c quan tr\u1ecdng, minh ch\u1ee9ng cho s\u1ef1 tr\u01b0\u1edfng th\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t \u201cl\u00ean s\u1ed1\u201d hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. V\u1edbi th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng TM\u0110T Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ef1 b\u00e1o \u0111\u1ea1t kho\u1ea3ng 39 t\u1ef7 USD v\u00e0o n\u0103m 2025, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u1ef1 tin ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u xu h\u01b0\u1edbng shoppertainment v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QFOUdHK5loVYnBx87hAl9g7BgNf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c t\u1eebng l\u1ecdt v\u00e0o Top 3 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u00f3 GMV cao nh\u1ea5t tr\u00ean TikTok Shop Qu\u00fd 1\/2024 v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vinh danh l\u00e0 \u201c\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c Ecommerce Enabler h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u 2023\u201d, Lemon Digital \u0111ang ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng c\u1ee7ng c\u1ed1 v\u1ecb th\u1ebf v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u ng\u00e0nh TM\u0110T Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TtN0dkp4IoV1cex4wmwl67eyg2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DFFJdXj4Yoyujqxn5cvlQVqygDb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. C\u00e1c case study ti\u00eau bi\u1ec3u l\u00e0m n\u00ean t\u00ean tu\u1ed5i Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-VLsmds3XtoCe9Zx1ekqlRDCVgeb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m Thu\u1ea7n chay Shegan c\u1ee7a \u00e1 h\u1eadu Th\u00fay V\u00e2n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0QbdIix6oTbPxx1KZQlYoSdgte\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Lemon Digital, agency ti\u00ean phong trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 TikTok Shop t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ea7n chay SHeGAN c\u1ee7a \u00c1 h\u1eadu Th\u00fay V\u00e2n chinh ph\u1ee5c th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng. V\u1edbi chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c Direct-to-Consumer (D2C) s\u1eafc b\u00e9n k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p website Haravan v\u00e0 gian h\u00e0ng TikTok Shop, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 gi\u00fap SHeGAN \u0111\u1ea1t doanh thu t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng 250% trong s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Lemon Day, thu h\u00fat h\u01a1n 15.000 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 v\u01b0\u1ee3t 500 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng\/ng\u00e0y ch\u1ec9 sau 1 n\u0103m ra m\u1eaft.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EP38dsJlsoIHUqxilzBlHXixgeg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong Mega Campaign \u201cLemon Day\u201d v\u00e0o cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng 3\/2024, Lemon Digital l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong hai \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c c\u00f9ng TikTok Shop. , trong \u0111\u00f3 Shegan th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ea7n chay c\u1ee7a \u00c1 h\u1eadu Thu\u00fd V\u00e2n ghi nh\u1eadn doanh thu livestream t\u0103ng h\u01a1n 250% so v\u1edbi phi\u00ean tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-TBNUdImLsoxqKExxdoBlrqTog5F\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u00e1n l\u1ebb thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam Gear VN<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZJCdnNvNodVuwx9qPLlZknVgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4884\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4884\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4884\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/51-1.png\" alt=\"Lemon Digital s\u1eed \u0111\u1ee5ng n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh th\u1ef1c chi\u1ebfn - kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ecb th\u1ebf TikTok Shop Partner Of The Year 2025.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/51-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/51-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/51-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/51-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/51-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4884\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lemon Digital s\u1eed \u0111\u1ee5ng n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh th\u1ef1c chi\u1ebfn &#8211; kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ecb th\u1ebf TikTok Shop Partner Of The Year 2025.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G3XbdWbddoyD1dxjPA5lIh19gwh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UINNd202UoAsA8xVlB3lXCqAguh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea1i Lemon Digital, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i tin t\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0o tri\u1ebft l\u00fd \u2018Build to Sell\u2019 \u2013 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng t\u1eebng \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ea1m trong funnel b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch c\u00f3 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u00edch. Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u1ee7a GearVN, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1eeb 1,61% l\u00ean 3,34%, doanh thu g\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 t\u0103ng g\u1ea5p \u0111\u00f4i v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (ROAS) v\u01b0\u1ee3t h\u1eb3n chu\u1ea9n ng\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 minh ch\u1ee9ng r\u00f5 n\u00e9t cho c\u00e1ch ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u1eebng ph\u1ea7n nh\u1ecf \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb n\u1ed9i dung, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QDcKd5UyQoUc7yxvE0ylgBwsgfa\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch Mega Campaign Lemon Day b\u00f9ng n\u1ed5 to\u00e0n ng\u00e0nh v\u1edbi h\u00e0ng lo\u1ea1t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OP0FdZXyloJSQlxrLOjlWkIQg8d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Lemon Day l\u00e0 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh Mega Campaign h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c c\u00f9ng TikTok Shop, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quy t\u1ee5 22 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n 25 phi\u00ean livestream li\u00ean t\u1ee5c trong 24 gi\u1edd v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea1t t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng 300% so v\u1edbi ng\u00e0y b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hkoxd1VhnoJUNlxiRfZlCr2dgPo\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n r\u00f5 n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ph\u1ed1i ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh l\u1edbn, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u1ed9i dung gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng (shoppertainment), gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u gia t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 doanh s\u1ed1 v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UzlSdEg1so0TQ8x0EUrlMLPugn4\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Chu\u1ed7i th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111a s\u00e0n Polomanor, Logitech, Api,&#8230;v\u01b0\u01a1n t\u1ea7m t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng c\u00f9ng Lemon Digital <\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JJ2BdYKKMoZ4G8xslrWlpUCegJc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1eeb n\u0103m 2021 \u0111\u1ebfn gi\u1eefa n\u0103m 2025, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 100 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111a ng\u00e0nh, tri\u1ec3n khai h\u01a1n 250 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch TM\u0110T, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 t\u1ed5ng 300+ th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PeWtdySzgocAhUxkVkklXdAEg8v\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ti\u00eau bi\u1ec3u nh\u01b0 Polomanor (th\u1eddi trang), Logitech (c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7), Api (m\u1eb9 &amp; b\u00e9)\u2026 \u0111\u1ec1u ghi nh\u1eadn t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng qua v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh \u0111a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng (TikTok Shop, Shopee, Lazada, Haravan\u2026) v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QgFfdDzGLofxBux4zrjlVwxBgOe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-C3Y1dxmKvobTqdx4E0ulUQ7ngyh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. <\/strong><strong>\u201cTikTok Shop Partner Of The Year\u201d t\u1ea1i TikTok &#8211; B\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u1eb7t v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSL8dlWUMopjs3xUOrolCmZggSg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4882\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4882\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4882\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/49.png\" alt=\"Ph\u00e1t Nguy\u1ec5n \u2013 Co\u2011Founder c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital l\u00ean nh\u1eadn gi\u1ea3i TikTok Shop Partner of the Year\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/49.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/49-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/49-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/49-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/49-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4882\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ph\u00e1t Nguy\u1ec5n \u2013 Co\u2011Founder c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital l\u00ean nh\u1eadn gi\u1ea3i TikTok Shop Partner of the Year<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XXfgdHgKnoo7GNx3PDBlbnZgg6g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Lemon Digital lu\u00f4n h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1edbi tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng ti\u00ean phong trong ng\u00e0nh Social Commerce t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1. Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u00edch h\u1ee3p s\u00e2u d\u1eef li\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, tri\u1ec3n khai AI \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00f3a s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ea1o ra th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u s\u1ed1 mang t\u00ednh d\u1eabn d\u1eaft tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng nh\u01b0 TikTok Shop, Shopee, Lazada.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TPqrdYSRHoCv55xALXHlrjpLgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111o b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n b\u1eb1ng ni\u1ec1m tin v\u00e0 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng m\u00e0 ch\u00fang t\u00f4i mang l\u1ea1i cho t\u1eebng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c. Trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai, Lemon cam k\u1ebft ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ec3 khai ph\u00e1 t\u1ed1i \u0111a ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ed1, d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u xu h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u00e0 ki\u1ebfn t\u1ea1o gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ef1c b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 am hi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng. V\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i tin r\u1eb1ng Social Commerce s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 k\u00eanh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u2013 m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i s\u00e2u s\u1eafc gi\u1eefa th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QywXdBuJ5ovPQXxoboal7COJgIb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p>Lemon Digital s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh \u2013 t\u1eeb chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i \u2013 nh\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o ra h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u li\u1ec1n m\u1ea1ch, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t. H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc s\u1ebd c\u00f2n nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ed5i thay, nh\u01b0ng s\u1ee9 m\u1ec7nh c\u1ee7a Lemon lu\u00f4n r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng: gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng b\u1eb1ng gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p th\u1ef1c ti\u1ec5n, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 \u0111i tr\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9KWdu2pTo6MwFxvXFgltbDcgse\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0WcdXMVaocQq6xInUDlXkDrgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EPaNdzruqoJAnCxKvholpiArgGd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>N\u0103m 2025 ghi d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u1eb7t l\u1ecbch s\u1eed trong cu\u1ed9c h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital. T\u1ea1i TikTok Shop Vietnam Summit 2025 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ng\u00e0y 17\/7\/2025, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i vinh d\u1ef1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u01b0\u1edbng t\u00ean \u1edf danh m\u1ee5c danh gi\u00e1 nh\u1ea5t \u2014 \u2018TikTok Shop Partner Of The Year\u2019. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 danh hi\u1ec7u, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 l\u1eddi [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4880,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[40,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4879","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-su-kien","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4879","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4879"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4879\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5218,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4879\/revisions\/5218"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4880"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4879"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4879"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4879"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}